{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware The Willow Man as he lurks throughout the halls, in your dreams, and into your soul. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334060/extras/bathTub1.gif?t=1741389762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Willow Man is a survival horror game where you take on the shoes of Rin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rin and her friends decide one day to explore a house on the hill. Rumours have spread</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">about that place. Some say evil dwells there. Unfazed by this they enter and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">what awaits them is not what they expected. Survive, hide, find a way out before</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Willow Man finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334060/extras/RunGif1.gif?t=1741389762\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frantic Chases</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanity Meter</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Fights</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive, Fight, or Hide to survive the night</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Art brimming with personality</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334060/extras/CharactersForDescriptionArt.png?t=1741389762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334060/extras/mikapulls1.gif?t=1741389762\" /></p>",